activity File Patent Application
activity File Trademark Application
activity File Copyright Registration
activity Conduct Patent Search
activity Conduct Trademark Search
activity Examine Patent Application
activity Examine Trademark Application
activity Examine Copyright Application
activity Grant Patent
activity Reject Patent Application
activity Grant Trademark
activity Reject Trademark Application
activity Grant Copyright
activity Reject Copyright Application
activity Appeal Decision
bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind File Copyright Registration: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Patent Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Conduct Trademark Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Examine Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Examine Copyright Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Patent: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Patent Application: Application ID, Decision
bind Grant Trademark: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Trademark Application: Application ID, Decision
bind Grant Copyright: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Copyright Application: Application ID, Decision
bind Appeal Decision: Application ID
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000000
Application Fee: float between 50.0 and 10000.0
Search Result: Clear, Conflict
Application Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Decision: Granted, Rejected
Init[File Patent Application] | |
Choice[Grant Patent, Reject Patent Application] | | |
Response[Conduct Patent Search, Examine Patent Application] |A.Search Result is Clear |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,2,d
Response[Examine Patent Application, Grant Patent] |A.Application Status is Approved |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Response[Examine Patent Application, Reject Patent Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Response[Conduct Trademark Search, Examine Trademark Application] |A.Search Result is Clear |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,2,d
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Grant Trademark] |A.Application Status is Approved |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Reject Trademark Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Response[File Copyright Registration, Examine Copyright Application] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,2,d
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Grant Copyright] |A.Application Status is Approved |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Reject Copyright Application] |A.Application Status is Rejected |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |0,1,d
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Patent Application] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Trademark Application] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Copyright Application] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |